usage: android_acceptance.py [-h] --apk APK --package
                             {app.xio.xio,app.xio.client} --version-code
                             VERSION_CODE --apk-sha256 APK_SHA256
                             --cert-sha256 CERT_SHA256 [--serial SERIAL] --adb
                             ADB --aapt AAPT --apksigner APKSIGNER --out OUT
                             [--samples SAMPLES] [--interval INTERVAL]
                             [--exercise] [--airplane-cycle]

Identity-pinned, collect-only Android evidence. No install/focus/screenshot
API. Exercise mode records OPERATOR observations, not a claim that VPN traffic
passed. Only exercise mode may restore airplane/WiFi; a radio cycle needs a
second flag.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --apk APK
  --package {app.xio.xio,app.xio.client}
  --version-code VERSION_CODE
  --apk-sha256 APK_SHA256
  --cert-sha256 CERT_SHA256
  --serial SERIAL
  --adb ADB
  --aapt AAPT
  --apksigner APKSIGNER
  --out OUT             New, nonexisting output directory
  --samples SAMPLES
  --interval INTERVAL
  --exercise
  --airplane-cycle
